"wa-innamā","l":5,"g":[["وَ","CONJ","prefix","w:CONJ"],["إِنَّ","ACC","stem",""],["مَآ","PREV","stem",""]]},{"i":"67:26:7","a":"أَنَا۠","t":"I am","p":"PRON","tr":"anā","f":["1S"],"l":180},{"i":"67:26:8","a":"نَذِيرٌۭ","t":"a warner","p":"N","tr":"nadhīrun","f":["M","INDEF","NOM"],"r":82,"l":206},{"i":"67:26:9","a":"مُّبِينٌۭ","t":"clear","p":"ADJ","tr":"mubīnun","f":["ACT","PCPL","(IV)","M","INDEF","NOM"],"r":9,"l":100},{"e":"٢٦","v":"67:26"}]}],"verses":[{"k":"67:13","t":"And conceal your speech or publicize it; indeed, He is Knowing of that within the breasts.","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":13,"sd":null},{"k":"67:14","t":"Does He who created not know, while He is the Subtle, the Aware?","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":14,"sd":null},{"k":"67:15","t":"It is He who made the earth tame for you - so walk among its slopes and eat of His provision - and to Him is the resurrection.","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":15,"sd":null},{"k":"67:16","t":"Do you feel secure that He who is above would not cause the earth to swallow you and suddenly it would sway?","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":16,"sd":null},{"k":"67:17","t":"Or do you feel secure that He who is above would not send against you a storm of stones? Then you would know how [severe] was My warning.","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":17,"sd":null},{"k":"67:18","t":"And already had those before them denied, and how [terrible] was My reproach.","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":18,"sd":null},{"k":"67:19","t":"Do they not see the birds above them with wings outspread and [sometimes] folded in? None holds them [aloft] except the Most Merciful. Indeed He is, of all things, Seeing.","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":19,"sd":null},{"k":"67:20","t":"Or who is it that could be an army for you to aid you other than the Most Merciful? The disbelievers are not but in delusion.","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":20,"sd":null},{"k":"67:21","t":"Or who is it that could provide for you if He withheld His provision? But they have persisted in insolence and aversion.","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":21,"sd":null},{"k":"67:22","t":"Then is one who walks fallen on his face better guided or one who walks erect on a straight path?","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":22,"sd":null},{"k":"67:23","t":"Say, \"It is He who has produced you and made for you hearing and vision and hearts [i.e., intellect]; little are you grateful.\"","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":23,"sd":null},{"k":"67:24","t":"Say, \"It is He who has multiplied you throughout the earth, and to Him you will be gathered.\"","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":24,"sd":null},{"k":"67:25","t":"And they say, \"When is this promise, if you should be truthful?\"","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":25,"sd":null},{"k":"67:26","t":"Say, \"The knowledge is only with Allāh, and I am only a clear warner.\"","j":29,"h":57,"s":67,"a":26,"sd":null}],"juz":29,"hizb":57,"surahs":[67],"sajdah":false}